                "recommended": "<strong>Recomendados:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Sistema Operativo *:</strong> x64 versions of Microsoft Windows 7 (SP1), 8.1 and 10<br></li><li><strong>Processador:</strong> AMD / Intel Quad-Core processor running at 3.5 GHz (AMD FX-8000 series or Intel Core i3 6000 series or newer architectures are recommended).<br></li><li><strong>Memória:</strong> 8192 MB de RAM<br></li><li><strong>Placa gráfica:</strong> NVIDIA dedicated graphic card, with at least 3072MB of dedicated VRAM and with at least DirectX 11 and Shader Model 5.0 support (AMD R9 380 and NVIDIA GeForce GTX 970 are minimum recommended GPU architectures).<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Versão 11<br></li><li><strong>Rede:</strong> Ligação à Internet de banda larga<br></li><li><strong>Espaço no disco:</strong> Requer 15 GB de espaço livre<br></li><li><strong>Placa de som:</strong> Integrated or dedicated DirectX 9 compatible soundcard</li></ul>"
